   "txt": "**1. Single Most Important Fact**\nThe Ministry of Defence (vide letter dated 22 September 2024) has approved the extension of tenure of Shri Biju George (DIN: 09343562) as Director (Operations) effective from 27 October 2026 until his superannuation on 28 February 2029, or until further orders, whichever is earlier.\n\n**2. Key Numbers Exactly as Stated**\n* No financial metrics, contract values, or operating figures were reported in this filing.\n* Relevant administrative reference: Ministry of Defence Letter No. `4/1(1)/2019/D(NS)` dated 22 September 2024; previous appointment letter dated 27 October 2021.\n\n**3. Management Guidance / Outlook**\n* None provided in the document.\n\n**4. What a Shareholder Should Watch or Act On**\n* No action required; observe ongoing operational execution and project delivery under continued operational leadership through February 2029.\n\n**5. One-Line Net Read**\n* **Neutral**: Routine governance and tenure extension ensuring long-term leadership stability in core operations."
